msgid "Concepts  Glossary"
msgstr "概念  术语表"

#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:92
msgid "Defined use cases and business processes related to the utilization of Verifiable Digital Health Certificates;"
msgstr "与可验证数字健康证书的使用相关的既定用例和业务流程；"

#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:81
msgid "Document Signer"
msgstr "文档签名者"

#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:84
msgid "Document Signer Certificates (DSCs)"
msgstr "文档签名者证书（DSCs）"

#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:85
msgid "Document Signer Certificates are the public key certificates associated to Document Signers which are issued or recognized by the GDHCN Participant."
msgstr "文档签名者证书是与文档签名者相关联、由 GDHCN 参与方签发或认可的公钥证书。"

#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:70
msgid "Each GDHCN Participant maintains one or more Signing Certificate Authority (SCA), certificates of which are relatively long lived. The SCA issues public key certificates for the national, short lived, Document Signers.  The SCA acts as a trust anchor such that relying GDHCN Participants can use the SCA certificate to validate the authenticity and integrity of the regularly changing DSC certificates."
msgstr "每个 GDHCN 参与方维护一个或多个签名者证书颁发机构（SCA），其证书的有效期相对较长。SCA 为本国短期有效的文档签名者签发公钥证书。SCA 充当信任锚，使依赖方 GDHCN 参与方能够使用 SCA 证书验证定期更换的 DSC 证书的真实性和完整性。"

